<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia's Kolinska to list more shares.</title>
<headline>Slovenia's Kolinska to list more shares.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenian food processing company Kolinska will increase the number of its shares listed on the Ljubljana stock exchange on May 5, the bourse said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Kolinska will list another 650,977 shares, raising the total to 3,248,048 shares or 91.0 percent of its equity.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, Kolinska rose 0.94 percent to close at 2,050 tolars on volume of 936 shares. -- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
